<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 6.736 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield 6.736 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   6.867	 6.830-6.890 6.886</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 200 million, pct allotted at top 3)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   6.736	 6.710-6.750 6.759</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 400 million, pct allotted at top 32)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS600 million   6.688	 6.670-6.700 6.688</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 300 million, pct allotted at top 75)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
